From: robyroro <41092915+robyroro@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 02:55:51 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] signin: ask Google for web accounts only when Ghost enables
 it

GaiaCookieManagerService::TriggerListAccounts() returns without queuing
a request unless ghost::kGoogleAccountsInCookieJar is enabled. The
/ListAccounts request sends the user's Google cookies to
accounts.google.com. It is sent whenever anything reads the account
list while it is stale, which a fresh profile does at startup, and when
Google's sign-in cookies change. This is the only place the request is
queued, so the list stays empty and stale; its readers already handle
that state, which is where they start before the first answer.

Why: about twenty callers read the list through IdentityManager, and
none of the switches or prefs that disable browser sign-in stop it.
Upstream: not upstreamable: product-specific service policy

Signed-off-by: robyroro <41092915+robyroro@users.noreply.github.com>

diff --git a/components/signin/internal/identity_manager/BUILD.gn b/components/signin/internal/identity_manager/BUILD.gn
index 0391a4450013bc8ccfdeded7953e80b3b8f96e43..1cd9e6318cb0b3d6102ee0f5335b259d3ae46759 100644
--- a/components/signin/internal/identity_manager/BUILD.gn
+++ b/components/signin/internal/identity_manager/BUILD.gn
@@ -73,6 +73,7 @@ source_set("identity_manager") {
     "//components/unexportable_keys",
     "//components/version_info",
     "//crypto",
+    "//ghost/components/signin:features",
     "//services/network/public/cpp",
     "//ui/gfx",
   ]
diff --git a/components/signin/internal/identity_manager/gaia_cookie_manager_service.cc b/components/signin/internal/identity_manager/gaia_cookie_manager_service.cc
index db2e0266aa2200f23d47eba563dac73e96fef1c7..d19c59f9d5fb58e0e0e4fd02eacc5968afcc01dd 100644
--- a/components/signin/internal/identity_manager/gaia_cookie_manager_service.cc
+++ b/components/signin/internal/identity_manager/gaia_cookie_manager_service.cc
@@ -36,6 +36,7 @@
 #include "components/signin/public/base/signin_switches.h"
 #include "components/signin/public/identity_manager/accounts_in_cookie_jar_info.h"
 #include "components/signin/public/identity_manager/set_accounts_in_cookie_result.h"
+#include "ghost/components/signin/features.h"
 #include "google_apis/credentials_mode.h"
 #include "google_apis/gaia/gaia_constants.h"
 #include "google_apis/gaia/gaia_features.h"
@@ -525,6 +526,12 @@ GaiaCookieManagerService::GetCachedListAccounts() {
 }
 
 void GaiaCookieManagerService::TriggerListAccounts() {
+  // The request sends the user's Google cookies to accounts.google.com. It is
+  // queued only here, so the list stays empty and stale without it.
+  if (!base::FeatureList::IsEnabled(ghost::kGoogleAccountsInCookieJar)) {
+    return;
+  }
+
   // Callers suspect that a check to Gaia needs to be done, don't rely on the
   // in progress request, conditions might have changed while the request is
   // in-flight.
